      "body": "@Harry-Chen @khluu could one of you add the `ready` label? `pre-run-check`\r\ngates on the author having 4+ merged PRs in this repo, which I don't yet,\r\nso `pre-commit` is skipped and `buildkite/ci/pr` never reports.\r\n\r\nThe change is CI-config only — it adds the 16 root-level test files that no\r\nBuildkite step currently names to the Engine Core step. I ran 13 of them\r\nlocally (96 tests, all passing); the other 3 need a real build and are\r\ndescribed in the PR body.",
